  ('zcrm_5797994000002528186', 'Dionysus Digital Health', 'Dionysus Digital Health', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Andrea Cubitt', 'Developer of an epigenetic testing platform designed to predict and diagnose conditions like postpartum depression before symptoms manifest. The company''s platform analyzes stress patterns and hormonal changes to help identify at-risk individuals early, which allows preventive care during pregnancy or shortly after childbirth, enabling healthcare providers to facilitate timely interventions like therapy, medication, or stress management strategies.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-26 10:43:51', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002528212', 'Sherpa RX', 'Sherpa RX', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Jeff McCormack', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence-based clinical decision support technology designed to make personalized and precise medicine for patients worldwide. The company''s platform provides tools and insights to help healthcare providers manage extensive medical data, make informed decisions, and establish effective treatment plans tailored to the genetic makeup of each patient, enabling clients to navigate the complexities of healthcare with precision and confidence.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-26 10:49:52', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002528238', 'Carina Medical', 'Carina Medical', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Xue Feng', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence (AI)-based medical image analysis software designed for radiation oncology and radiology applications. The company''s software provides novel technologies for efficient radiation treatment, which will assist in both computed tomography and magnetic resonance imaging-based organ segmentation and site-specific segmentation models to enhance the robustness of the AI system, enabling doctors with efficient workflow for radiation therapy and improve cancer treatment.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-26 10:57:49', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002528259', 'Topaz Biosciences', 'Topaz Biosciences', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Jennifer Shock', 'Developer of enzyme-based ingredients designed for rebalancing the skin microbiome. The company''s platform utilizes natural biodiversity and synthetic biology to design enzymes that selectively reduce harmful bacteria while preserving beneficial ones, enabling researchers to address conditions such as eczema and acne through clinically proven formulations that restore skin health.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-26 11:03:03', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002528285', 'DeepkinetiX', 'DeepkinetiX', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Ali Ghayoor', 'Developer of AI-driven model-informed software designed to optimize pharmaceutical drug development. The company''s platform utilizes model-informed drug development and AI-driven predictive insights, simulating and predicting drug behavior to reduce research and development costs and time, enabling pharmaceutical companies, hospitals, contract research organizations, drug development companies, and biotech startups to gain insights into drug pharmacokinetics and pharmacodynamics, predict clinical trial outcomes, and accelerate the drug development process.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-26 11:06:30', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002528311', 'Inflammasome Therapeutics', 'Inflammasome Therapeutics', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Paul Ashton', 'Developer of therapies designed to focus on prevalent, degenerative diseases such as Alzheimer''s and multiple sclerosis. The company''s products are effective on diseases that are all characterized by upregulation of the inflammatory process, driven by prolonged activation of cytosolic multiprotein, enabling patients to reduce and prevent aberrant inflammasome activation.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Shreeya Shenoy', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-26 11:10:29', '2025-08-26 07:44:23', '2025-08-26 07:44:23'),
