  ('zcrm_5797994000002549019', 'Ribbiot', 'Ribbiot', 'Sam Mason', 'Triet Nguyen', 'Ribbiot is an end-to-end operations management platform purpose-built for physical industries, unifying people, processes, and equipment into a single system. Existing software solutions—Samsara for asset tracking, Procore for project management, and ServiceTitan for field service—address only isolated workflows and fail to integrate across the full job lifecycle. This fragmentation is why 98% of projects are delayed and 83% run over budget. Ribbiot connects the entire workflow which is why companies are shutting down previous initiatives and replacing their fragmented systems to standardize on Ribbiot.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2025', 'Sam Mason', 'Have not Reached out', 'Sam Mason', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-02 08:35:24', '2025-04-16 07:37:04', '2025-04-16 07:37:04'),
