  ('zcrm_5797994000002550118', 'GuidenAI', 'GuidenAI', 'Jordan Marquez', 'Katelyn H', 'We specialize in developing innovative AI-powered products that enhance and simplify everyday experiences through intelligent automation and advanced technology. Our products include: Broxi AI (2025): AI Agent Creation Platform. GuidenAI AI Travel App (2024): AI-powered travel app that simplifies trip planning and navigation for womenself-travelers. Got 50,000+ downloads in 2 months.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jordan Marquez', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-02 07:26:56', '2025-05-08 10:00:08', '2025-05-08 10:00:08'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002550144', 'Relm AI', 'RelmAI', 'Jordan Marquez', 'Evan Robinson', 'The core of Relm''s technology is visual search AI, which enables users to search for features that traditional real estate filters can''t capture. At its core, real estate is a visualasset, but traditional listing sites only let users search through agent-entered data that attempts to descriptively represent what the property actually is. Relm''s search is powerful and useful because our visual technology eliminates the need for the search process to rely on representative data.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jordan Marquez', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-02 07:27:58', '2025-05-08 10:00:03', '2025-05-08 10:00:03'),
