  ('zcrm_5797994000002824280', 'Fordefi', 'Fordefi', 'Luke Boudreau', 'Josh Schwartz', 'Fordefi is an institutional MPC wallet and security platform designed for decentralised finance. It provides MPC key management, self-service DeFi policy controls, time-of-transaction smart contract insights, transaction simulation, and risk alerts. The MPC wallet platform and Web3 gateway from Fordefi enables institutions to connect to dApps across multiple chains while keeping digital assets secure.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Have not Reached out', 'Luke Boudreau', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-04-29 10:51:33', '2025-08-26 11:10:43', '2025-08-26 11:10:43'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002824318', 'Sohar Health', 'Sohar Health', 'Luke Boudreau', 'Ashish Mandavia', 'Sohar Health is an AI-driven company that offers front-end Revenue Cycle Management (RCM) solutions. The services focus on enhancing healthcare providers'' insurance verification processes, aiming to improve efficiency and reduce claim denials. Sohar Health utilizes advanced technology to streamline eligibility checks and facilitate better pricing transparency. The platform caters primarily to the needs of sales teams and sales development representatives in the healthcare sector. By automating key processes, Sohar Health helps organizations optimize their revenue cycle operations.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Have not Reached out', 'Luke Boudreau', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-04-29 11:02:25', '2025-08-26 11:10:48', '2025-08-26 11:10:48'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002824354', 'Blockus', 'Blockus', 'Luke Boudreau', 'Jess Zhang', 'Blockus exists at the intersection of Web3, blockchain NTFs, and gaming - the company provides an all-in-one ecosystem for Web3 gaming with seamless integration into WaaS and first-party NFT marketplaces.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Have not Reached out', 'Luke Boudreau', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-04-29 11:16:08', '2025-08-26 11:10:14', '2025-08-26 11:10:14'),
