  ('zcrm_5797994000003166105', 'Gold H2', 'Gold H2', 'Ty Legeyt', 'Prabhdeep Sekhon', 'Gold H2 is a Houston-based climate tech company that produces clean hydrogen by stimulating naturally occurring subsurface microbes to convert stranded oil in depleted reservoirs, leveraging existing oilfield infrastructure. Its “Black 2 Gold (B2G)” process circulates treatment fluids through old injection/production wells to create an H₂-rich stream that’s separated and routed to end uses—positioned as a scalable, low-carbon pathway targeting sub-$1/kg hydrogen.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ty LeGeyt', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Market Outlook', 'Ty LeGeyt', '2025-08-25 11:38:21', '2025-08-28 14:10:35', '2025-08-28 14:10:35'),
