  ('zcrm_5797994000003171036', 'FutureMoney', 'FutureMoney', 'Alexander Hilton', 'Phillip Barrar', 'Micro-investment platform for parents, couples, and individuals to build wealth for their children and themselves with modest weekly deposits. The platform offers goal-based investment accounts and an exclusive Junior Roth IRA™ that enables tax free growth for children''s futures without earned employment income.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Alex Hilton', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', 'Market Outlook;Too Early', NULL, '2025-08-25 16:29:05', '2025-12-05 11:03:12', '2025-12-05 11:03:12'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003171074', 'Chaiz', 'Chaiz', 'Alexander Hilton', 'Reto Bolliger', 'Chaiz is the first online marketplace for vehicle protection, empowering consumers to research, compare, and buy protection online with just a few clicks. Chaiz’s technology is fully embeddable, allowing P2P platforms, direct lenders, transaction-based marketplaces, and online dealers to offer a seamless and transparent customer experience when buying extended vehicle protection.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Alex Hilton', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', 'Vertical/Thesis Fit', NULL, '2025-08-26 05:22:19', '2025-12-05 11:03:50', '2025-12-05 11:03:50'),
