  ('zcrm_5797994000003173112', 'Allmind AI', 'Allmind AI', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Anwaar Malik', 'AllMind AI is building the unified data and AI workspace for institutional investors. Investment teams waste 80% of their time cleaning data before they can think about a trade—costing firms millions annually. Our platform provides a Bloomberg-grade terminal for analysts, high-speed APIs for quants, and an AI co-pilot that drafts research reports in under 30 minutes. We''re processing two petabytes monthly with four hedge funds in paid pilots and are working directly with AI leaders such as Google and Cohere. Show Less', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-08-26 09:14:36', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003173202', 'Skylark AI', 'Skylark AI', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Pramod Singh', 'Skylark AI is a comprehensive and transformative AI solution that has been purpose built to intake, categorize, and understand disparate financial data. The Sky Data Engine that backs Skylarks core product is composed of 10 different models each specializing in a separate part of the investment analysis and portfolio management process.', 'HV Genesis', 'Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Jacob Dooley', 'Rejected', 'Financial Innovation', NULL, NULL, '2025-08-27 05:57:35', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
