  ('zcrm_5797994000003193592', 'Prosper', 'Prosper', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Richard Hamilton', 'Operator of a biotechnology company intended to slow down the aging process and revitalize health. The company has an internal dashboard linked to epigenetics, which are biomarkers that lie on top of the genetic code by controlling the way it works and as the lifestyle changes, these markers change while DNA sequence can''t be altered, enabling customers to make informed lifestyle choices and proactive health decisions, with the ultimate goal of promoting healthier and longer lives.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Kishan Angadi', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-09-07 16:56:39', '2026-01-28 11:50:40', '2026-01-28 11:50:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003194014', 'Concentro', 'concentro', 'Ty Legeyt', 'Inigo Melia', 'Concentro is a fintech platform that streamlines the sale and purchase of clean energy tax credits, with a particular focus on distributed generation projects like community solar, EV charging, and storage. By combining diligence, legal support, and insurance into a single AI-enabled marketplace, it helps smaller developers access capital while enabling corporations to efficiently offset their tax liabilities.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability;Financial Innovation', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ty LeGeyt', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-08-29 04:33:49', '2025-09-19 07:04:40', '2025-09-19 07:04:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003194044', 'PolyGone', 'PolyGone', 'Ty Legeyt', 'Nathaniel Banks', 'PolyGone Systems is a cleantech startup developing proprietary filtration media to capture and remove microplastics from water systems. Their modular “Poly Pod” technology enables scalable, low-maintenance deployment in treatment plants, reservoirs, and rivers to help address the growing global microplastic crisis.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ty LeGeyt', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-08-31 13:01:00', '2025-10-28 16:13:57', '2025-10-28 16:13:57'),
