  ('zcrm_5797994000003196034', 'Little Otter', 'Little Otter', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Helen Egger', 'Little Otter is a pediatric mental health company that provides accessible, evidence-based care for children and families through telehealth services. Their platform connects families with licensed therapists, psychiatrists, and parent coaches to support emotional and behavioral development from early childhood onward.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-08-30 14:14:31', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196070', 'Yourway Learning', 'Yourway Learning', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Jaime Pales', 'ChatGPT said:
Yourway Learning is an EdTech company that helps K–12 teachers with AI-powered tools for lesson planning, grading, and student support. Their platform makes it easier for educators to personalize learning and reduce busywork. The goal is to give teachers more time to focus on students while improving classroom outcomes.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-08-31 09:35:12', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196105', 'Praxis Labs', 'Praxis Labs', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Elise Smith', 'Praxis Labs is a learning and development company that uses immersive VR and AR experiences to drive diversity, equity, and inclusion (DEI) in the workplace. Their platform combines research-backed curriculum with real-world scenarios to help employees practice inclusive leadership and behavior change. By focusing on experiential learning, Praxis Labs equips organizations with tools to build more equitable, empathetic, and high-performing cultures.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-08-31 15:35:20', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196145', 'Journey Live', 'Journey Live', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Stephen Sokoler', 'Journey Live is a mental health and wellness platform that offers live, interactive group sessions led by licensed therapists and mindfulness experts. It partners with employers and organizations to provide employees with accessible support for stress, anxiety, and overall well-being. By combining clinical expertise with engaging, community-based experiences, Journey Live makes mental health care more approachable and scalable.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-08-31 15:40:31', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196180', 'Home From College', 'Home From College', 'Eyiram Dodoo', 'Julia Haber', 'Home From College is the professional development platform built specifically for career starters and young professionals.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Eyiram', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Eyiram', '2025-08-31 16:12:07', '2025-10-27 13:08:20', '2025-10-27 13:08:20'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196220', 'Blackrock Nuerotech', 'Blackrock Nuerotech', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Marcus Gerhardt', 'Blackrock Neurotech is a neurotechnology company that develops implantable brain-computer interface (BCI) systems. Their technology allows people with paralysis, neurological disorders, or sensory loss to restore functions like movement, communication, and control of digital devices directly through brain signals. The company’s mission is to improve quality of life and ultimately help patients regain independence through cutting-edge neural engineering solutions.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-01 18:27:18', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196260', 'Sonera Magnetics', 'Sonera Magnetics', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Nishita Deka', 'Sonera is pioneering non-invasive biomagnetic sensing through wearable technology that can detect neural and muscle activity without direct skin contact. Their first product, the S1 chip, is small, low-power, and affordable, making it easy to integrate into consumer devices like smartwatches and rings. By democratizing access to neural data, Sonera aims to transform human-computer interaction and unlock new possibilities in health tracking, mental wellness, and biometric insights.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-01 18:32:56', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196300', 'Orbit Technologies', 'Orbit Technologies', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Steven Pang', 'Orbit Technologies is a neurotech company founded by Steven Pang that makes virtual reality feel real without the need for surgery or implants. By using gentle stimulation behind the ears to activate the brain’s movement centers, Orbit creates natural, immersive sensations of motion and presence in VR. Their mission is to redefine digital experiences by making them more engaging, accessible, and lifelike.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-01 18:38:29', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196352', 'Subsense', 'Subsense', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Tatiana Aleskandrova', 'Subsense is a neurotechnology startup developing non-invasive brain–computer interface (BCI) solutions that allow people to intuitively control devices without the need for surgery or implants. By focusing on accessibility and everyday usability, Subsense aims to make neural interaction seamless, opening new opportunities in communication, health, and human–computer interaction. Their mission is to bridge the gap between advanced neuroscience and practical applications that can improve quality of life.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-01 18:48:45', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196404', 'Inner Cosmos', 'Inner Cosmos', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Meron​ Gribetz​', 'ChatGPT said:
Inner Cosmos is a neurotechnology startup developing a minimally invasive brain–computer interface implant, often called a “digital pill for the mind,” to treat depression in patients who don’t respond to conventional therapies. Their system combines a tiny implant placed under the skin with an external prescription pod that powers and monitors the device, enabling clinicians to adjust treatment remotely. Backed by around $12M in funding and FDA approval to begin clinical trials, Inner Cosmos is working to make personalized, scalable mental health treatment a reality.', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-02 14:57:06', '2026-01-05 14:55:36', '2026-01-05 14:55:36'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196439', 'Mind Portal', 'Mind Portal', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Ekram Alam', 'MindPortal is a neurotechnology startup advancing human–AI communication by decoding imagined speech using a non-invasive, optical brain–computer interface. Their flagship models—MindSpeech and MindGPT—translate free-flowing thoughts into text in real time, enabling seamless, telepathic dialogue with AI systems like ChatGPT. Their breakthrough represents the first demonstration of continuous thought-to-language decoding via non-invasive brain sensors. Founded in 2019 by Ekram Alam and Jack Baber, MindPortal is backed by notable investors including Y Combinator and has assembled a scientific team from top institutions like Oxford, Cambridge, and DARPA', 'HV Genesis', 'Human Development', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Nikhil Tailor', 'Rejected', 'Human Development', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-02 15:08:24', '2026-01-05 14:52:58', '2026-01-05 14:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003196481', 'Fresh Flora', 'Fresh Flora-prebiotic gum', 'Ondrea Kerr', 'Marcus Costa', 'Uconn Dental Student and faculty propose a prebiotic chewing gum for oral health. Previsionary patent granted for their gum formulation.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2025', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Ondrea Kerr', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-03 13:01:43', '2025-09-19 11:57:35', '2025-09-19 11:57:35'),
